     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Bright Futures 4th edition does not publish a separate \"2‑week\" health‑supervision chapter"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": ", and there is "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "no CDC 2‑week milestone checklist"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (S3). The periodicity schedule lists a "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Newborn"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " visit, a "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "3–5 day"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " visit, and a "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "\"By 1 month\""
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " visit — no distinct 2‑week column. The 2‑week contact falls "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "between the First Week (3–5 Day) visit and the 1‑Month visit"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": ", and its content is drawn from those two. This is a genuine gap in the source set, not an omission."
     }
    ]
   },
